          "message": "M-15 lacks an application-path test for integrity/signature failures. Add a test that triggers the case integrity failure and asserts the alert event is emitted.",
          "confidence": 0.95,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The BasisIntegrityException handler emits the M-15 integrity/signature event. The tests call EmitSecurityEvent directly for each event name, but do not exercise this handler; the app-path test covers only unauthenticated requests.",
            "failureScenario": "If the handler stops emitting the event, the helper and Terraform alert tests still pass. A case integrity failure then produces no event for the configured alert to count, leaving this M-15 behavior untested."
